hadiths[5]{hadithnumber,text}:
"879","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko roka gaya. To Aap ne apna sar mundwaaya aur apni biwiyon se milay aur apni qurbaani zibah ki yahan tak ke Aap ne aaney waley saal Umrah kya. (Bukhari: 1809)"
"880","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, wo kehtey hain: Kya tumhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sunnat kaafi nahi hai? Agar tum mein se koi Hajj se roka jaey to Bait aur Safa aur Marwa ka tawaaf karey, phir har cheez se halaal ho jaey yahan tak ke aaney waley saal Hajj karey. Phir qurbaani dey ya rozah rakkhey agar qurbaani na paaey. (Bukhari: 1810)"
"881","[AI-translation] Miswar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mundwaanay se pehley qurbani zibah ki aur apne sahaaba ko uska hukm diya. (Bukhari: 1811)"
"882","[AI-translation] Kaab bin Ujra (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Hudaibiya mein merey paas khadey huey jabke mera sar juon se bhar raha tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tumhaarey keeday tumhey takleef detey hain? Main ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: To apna sar mundwaao ya farmaya: Mundo. Unhon-ne kaha: Merey baarey mein ye aayat naazil hui: (Phir jo tum mein beemaar ho ya usey apne sar mein takleef ho) aakhir tak. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Teen din rozey rakkho ya faraq chhe (miskeenon) mein sadqa karo ya jo muyassar ho qurbaani karo. (Bukhari: 1815)"
"883","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Kaab Raziallahu anhu se) aik riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: Merey baarey mein khaas naazil hui aur wo tumharey liye aam hai. Shikaar key badley ki kitaab."
